  "prefLabel": "Lot 7202.35 Rake",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7202.35 “Rake” means a portion of each hand collected by the game operator as compensation for running the game, a proportion of which is shared with the licensed, hosting charitable organization and the state of New Hampshire in accordance with RSA 287-D:19, III(f) and RSA 287-D:20, II.\n\nSource. #12839, eff 7-27-19, ss by #14341, EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25 (formerly Lot 7202.13); ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7202.24)",
